<title>QORIX — Технологии твоего стиля</title>

<style>

*{box-sizing:border-box}

body{margin:0;background:#090b10;color:#f5f5fa;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}

header{padding:22px 7%;border-bottom:1px solid #292d38;font-size:28px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:5px}

header span{color:#a78bfa}

.hero{padding:85px 7%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 30%,#302044,#090b10 65%)}

.tag{color:#a78bfa;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:12px}

